<section id="en" lang="en">
<h1>Terms of Sale</h1>
<p class="note">Version of <span class="todo">[TO BE FILLED IN BY THE OWNER: date]</span>. They apply to every purchase made on the website of the game REALMSHARD. The French version prevails.</p>

<h2>1. Seller</h2>
<p><span class="todo">[TO BE FILLED IN BY THE OWNER: name or company name, legal form, address, SIRET number, EU VAT number, contact e-mail]</span>.</p>

<h2>2. What is sold</h2>
<p>Digital content of the game: packs (boosters, Shards, Gold, cosmetics, a legendary card of your choice), Gold, Shards and the “Realm Pass” subscription. The exact contents of each offer are shown before you buy. Cosmetics have no effect on gameplay. Boosters contain random cards: their exact odds are shown in the game (“Drop rates” button). Nothing is sold in the mobile app.</p>

<h2>3. Prices and payment</h2>
<p>Prices are in euros, all taxes included. Payment is made by card through Stripe; we never see your card details. One account cannot spend more than €50 over 30 days. “1 per account” offers can be bought once per account.</p>

<h2>4. Account and delivery</h2>
<p>A REALMSHARD account with a confirmed e-mail address is needed to buy (a guest session cannot buy): the purchase belongs to that account. The content is delivered immediately after payment, into the save slot active at the time of purchase (Gold, Shards, boosters, legendary card of your choice); cosmetics and the Pass apply to the whole account. If anything goes wrong, the “Restore purchases” button reads your purchases again.</p>

<h2>5. Right of withdrawal</h2>
<p>For digital content delivered immediately, you expressly request that immediate delivery and acknowledge that you lose your 14-day right of withdrawal (French Consumer Code, article L221-28 13°). This consent is collected with an unticked box before payment and repeated in the receipt sent by e-mail.</p>

<h2>6. Realm Pass (subscription)</h2>
<p>€4.99 per month, VAT included, no commitment, renewed every month until you cancel. You can cancel online at any time from “Manage / cancel” (Stripe portal); the perks last until the end of the paid month. Pass exclusives (the month’s card back, the season frame and title) come back for Shards 6 months later in the “Pass Archives”.</p>

<h2>7. Refunds</h2>
<p>Write to <span class="todo">[TO BE FILLED IN BY THE OWNER: support e-mail address]</span>. A refunded or disputed purchase is no longer granted; what was already spent in the game is not taken back. A purchase made by a minor without permission is refunded at the request of their legal guardian.</p>

<h2>8. Mediation and applicable law</h2>
<p>Consumer mediator: <span class="todo">[TO BE FILLED IN BY THE OWNER: mediator’s name, address and website]</span>. French law; the protective rules of your country of residence still apply.</p>

<h2>9. Personal data</h2>
<p>See the <a href="confidentialite.html">privacy policy</a>.</p>
